{"format":1,"key":"zone:blackfathom","path":"/lore/zone/blackfathom","name":"Blackfathom Deeps","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"blackfathom","name":"Blackfathom Deeps","path":"/lore/zone/blackfathom"},"levels":"Levels 24-32","description":"Twilight's Hammer cultists now gather in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, along the Zoram Strand in northwestern Ashenvale. The temple once…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:blackfathom","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Twilight's Hammer cultists now gather in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, along the Zoram Strand in northwestern Ashenvale. The temple once honored Elune, the night elven moon goddess. Naga and satyrs have joined the cult in veneration of Aku'mai, a primordial hydra and servant of an Old God.","Blackfathom Deeps once honored Elune, the night elven moon goddess. Long before the Great Sundering shattered ancient Kalimdor, Highborne masons raised gem-encrusted bridges through its splendid halls. Queen Azshara commanded the waters around the sacred moonwell, keeping salt seas and mountain streams apart. When the Sundering broke the world ten thousand years ago, the temple sank beneath the coastal waters of the Veiled Sea. It lay undisturbed for millennia, until foul whispers began to rise from the darkness below.","Twilight's Hammer cultists came to the sunken ruins, drawn by mad dreams and dark portents. Inside, they forged an unholy truce with coastal naga led by Lady Sarevess and prowling satyrs. Together, they desecrated the moonwell and enslaved the creatures nearby. Years of torment drove the giant sea turtle Ghamoo-ra mad. The brutal murloc Gelihast raised a blood shrine, and the caverns filled with fresh sacrifices. Under Twilight Lord Kelris, the cultists made the ruins a staging ground for the Old Gods' impending return."],"hash":"049d6d","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"d7ce945e50","sec":81},"female-narrator":{"sha":"9b2a8bb3f7","sec":87}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Blackfathom Deeps (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Blackfathom_Deeps_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Blackfathom Deeps","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Blackfathom_Deeps"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/aku-mai","n":"Aku'mai","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/twilight-lord-kelris","n":"Twilight Lord Kelris","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/lady-sarevess","n":"Lady Sarevess","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/scout-thaelrid","n":"Argent Guard Thaelrid","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1200-blackfathom-villainy","n":"Blackfathom Villainy","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1199-twilight-falls","n":"Twilight Falls","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/824-jeneu-of-the-earthen-ring","n":"Je'neu of the Earthen Ring","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/zoram-strand","n":"Zoram Strand","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/item/purified-kor-gem","n":"Purified Kor Gem","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/npc/gerrig-bonegrip","n":"Gerrig Bonegrip","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1442-seeking-the-kor-gem","n":"Seeking the Kor Gem","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/item/corrupted-kor-gem","n":"Corrupted Kor Gem","k":"item"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/aku-mai-s-lair","n":"Aku'mai's Lair","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/drowned-sacellum","n":"Drowned Sacellum","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/forgotten-pool","n":"Forgotten Pool","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/moonshrine-ruins","n":"Moonshrine Ruins","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/moonshrine-sanctum","n":"Moonshrine Sanctum","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/pool-of-ask-ar","n":"Pool of Ask'ar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/aku-mai","n":"Aku'mai","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/argent-guard-manados","n":"Argent Guard Manados","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/scout-thaelrid","n":"Argent Guard Thaelrid","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/baron-aquanis","n":"Baron Aquanis","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dawnwatcher-selgorm","n":"Dawnwatcher Selgorm","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dawnwatcher-shaedlass","n":"Dawnwatcher Shaedlass","k":"boss"},{"p":